<title>GERMANY: German bourse shuffles midcap MDAX index.</title>
<headline>German bourse shuffles midcap MDAX index.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four new index constituents are to join Germany's mid-cap MDAX index as of March 24, the German bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The newcomers are dialysis group Fresenius Medical Care, insurer Hannover Re, automobile firm Kiekert AG and preference shares of financial group MLP.</p>
<p>These will replace windows manufacturer Weru AG, utility VEW AG, speciality chemical group Ruetgerswerke AG and footwear retailer Salamander.</p>
